desc:
A unique free-for-all game heavily inspired by MM2 where you can practice your aim or strive to become the best of the best.

Group members get access to an exclusive gun!

This game is heavily inspired by Murder Mystery 2 (MM2), and I highly recommend checking out the original game: https://www.roblox.com/games/142823291/Murder-Mystery-2

Also, credits go to:

@Nikilis for creating the original game (MM2). Without it, this game wouldn't have been made today.

@Zyleak and @Thexz for creating the maps.

@IDontHaveAUse, @Nikilis, and @Roblox for some of the weapons/skins as well.

Note: Everything is subject to change or be reworked, as this game is still in BETA.

Tags(Ignore): MM2 Aim Trainer, FFA, Aim Practice, Murder Mystery 2, Knife Throwing, Gun Aim
